URL: https://github.com/ehrlinger/hvtiRtemplates,
    https://ehrlinger.github.io/hvtiRtemplates/
BugReports: https://github.com/ehrlinger/hvtiRtemplates/issues
Description: Versioned analysis job templates for the Cardiovascular Outcomes,
  Registries and Research (CORR) group within the Heart, Vascular and Thoracic
  Institute (HVTI) at the Cleveland Clinic. Provides the analysis-prefix
  taxonomy the group organizes jobs by, and resolves a template name to an
  installed file, so that a study binds to a versioned template rather than
  to a copy.
